# Package Manager

- ALWAYS use `npm` as the package manager. NEVER use `pnpm` or `yarn`.
- Use `npm install` to add dependencies, `npm run dev` to start dev server, `npm run build` to build.
- If a `pnpm-lock.yaml` file exists, delete it and use `package-lock.json` instead.

# Git Author

- Commits should use the author: `Alejandra Morales <moralejadesign@users.noreply.github.com>`
- Do not change the git config.

# Tech Stack

- Next.js 16 (App Router) with TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Framer Motion for animations
- Client-side only rendering via `next/dynamic` with `ssr: false`

# Language

- Always respond in Spanish.
